{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03839","headline":"单于川对雨二首 一 · 苏味道","name":"单于川对雨二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇朝遘行雨，薄晚屯密云。\n缘阶起素沫，竟水聚圆文。\n河柳低未举，山花落已芬。\n清尊久不荐，淹留遂待君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}